+
+```json [settings]
+{
+  "tabs": {
+    "min_width": 120
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### Maximum Width
+
+- Description: Maximum width of an editor tab in pixels. Longer titles are truncated in the middle. `null` keeps tabs as wide as their title.
+- Setting: `max_width`
+- Default: `null`
+
+**Options**
+
+A pixel value or `null`.
